WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
[DRUMMING]

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.580
[LAUGHS]

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.080
 I promise you, I
can teach you how

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.619
to play drums in
about two minutes.

00:00:15.619 --> 00:00:18.010
Uh, come on, here we go.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:18.510
Here we go.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.970
The first time I played,
I was five years old.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.850
I learned how to play
by watching my dad.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.190
This is the foundation
of who I am.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:30.050
Every single piece of me is
in these drums, everything.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.734
[DRUMMING]

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.038
One, two, three, go.

00:00:35.038 --> 00:00:36.830
In this MasterClass,
I'm going to teach you

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.630
how to find your rhythm.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.510
The fundamentals of percussion
and drumming, and how

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.068
to perform with a band.

00:00:43.068 --> 00:00:45.110
Some funk beats can be a
little more complicated.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.988
[DRUMMING]

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.020
It's still in time,
but it makes it funky.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.870
Now this next beat
consists of three sounds.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.310
So the first one is.

00:00:58.310 --> 00:00:59.530
[DRUMMING]

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.710
And then a slap.

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:02.270
My right hand is
going to keep time.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.920
[DRUMMING]

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.807
Someone said to me,
"You're a woman,

00:01:05.807 --> 00:01:07.265
who said that you
can be the best?"

00:01:07.265 --> 00:01:09.374
[DRUMMING]

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.790
I said "I can be the best."

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.680
Come on, uh!

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.480
If you don't have
drums, that's OK.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:20.510
Pick up an instrument, do
something, play and enjoy

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.210
yourself and make it fun.

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:25.550
Because when you know
what your passion is

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:28.260
and what your purpose
is and you go for it,

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:30.680
no one and nothing
can stand in your way.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.310
I'm Sheila E.

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.470
[DRUMMING]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.140
And this is my MasterClass.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.520
Play a little funk where the

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:44.870
MasterClass is in
the house, come on!

